            description: "Pollinizer number: 19. Hardiness zones: 4 5. Nebraska horticultural regions: A-E. Pollen-source cultivars: 1,2,3,4,5,6,7,8,11,12,13,15. Uses: Fresh Dessert Cooking. Source description: Extra hardy, excellent keeper, large size, attractive red. Flavor is rich and very high-quality, sweet. Source row also lists Connell Red as a red sport of Fireside. (Sources-5,6)"
